<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta
			name="viewport"
			content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"
		/>
		<link
			href="newAssets/css/bootstrap.css"
			rel="stylesheet"
		/>
		<link
			href="newAssets/css/main.css"
			rel="stylesheet"
		/>
		<link
			href="newAssets/css/responsive.css"
			rel="stylesheet"
		/>
		<title>Don non abouti — E-Maquis</title>
		<style>
			body {
				display: flex;
				justify-content: center;
				align-items: center;
				height: 100vh;
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fef2f2 0%, #fecaca 100%);
			}
			.error-card {
				background: white;
				border-radius: 20px;
				padding: 40px;
				max-width: 480px;
				width: 90%;
				text-align: center;
				box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
			}
			.error-icon {
				font-size: 4rem;
				margin-bottom: 15px;
				animation: shake 0.6s ease;
			}
			.error-card h2 {
				color: #991b1b;
				font-weight: 700;
				margin-bottom: 10px;
			}
			.error-card p {
				color: #6b7280;
				font-size: 1rem;
				line-height: 1.6;
			}
			.btn-retry {
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9966, #ff5e62);
				color: white;
				border: none;
				border-radius: 12px;
				padding: 12px 30px;
				font-weight: 600;
				font-size: 1rem;
				margin-top: 20px;
				text-decoration: none;
				display: inline-block;
				transition: all 0.3s;
			}
			.btn-retry:hover {
				transform: translateY(-2px);
				box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(255, 94, 98, 0.4);
				color: white;
				text-decoration: none;
			}
			.btn-home {
				color: #6b7280;
				font-size: 0.9rem;
				margin-top: 12px;
				display: inline-block;
				text-decoration: underline;
			}
			.btn-home:hover {
				color: #374151;
			}
			.redirect-text {
				color: #9ca3af;
				font-size: 0.8rem;
				margin-top: 15px;
			}
			@keyframes shake {
				0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); }
				20% { transform: translateX(-10px); }
				40% { transform: translateX(10px); }
				60% { transform: translateX(-5px); }
				80% { transform: translateX(5px); }
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<div class="error-card">
			<div class="error-icon">😔</div>
			<h2>Don non abouti</h2>
			<p>
				Le paiement n'a pas pu être finalisé. Cela peut arriver
				pour plusieurs raisons (annulation, solde insuffisant, erreur réseau).
			</p>
			<p style="font-size: 0.9rem;">
				Vous pouvez réessayer à tout moment. Votre générosité compte beaucoup pour nous ! 🙏
			</p>
			<a href="/" class="btn-retry">Réessayer un don</a>
			<br />
			<a href="/" class="btn-home">Retour à l'accueil</a>
			<p class="redirect-text">Redirection automatique dans <span id="countdown">10</span>s...</p>
		</div>
		<script>
			let seconds = 10;
			const countdownEl = document.getElementById('countdown');
			const interval = setInterval(() => {
				seconds--;
				if (countdownEl) countdownEl.textContent = seconds;
				if (seconds <= 0) {
					clearInterval(interval);
					window.location.href = '/';
				}
			}, 1000);
		</script>
	</body>
</html>
